# Development Workflow

Stack (locked 2026-08-07): Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind v4, `motion/react`, Lenis (desktop pointer only), shadcn/ui restyled primitives, `next/font` self-hosted fonts, Vercel hosting. Verify framework APIs against `node_modules` docs, not memory.

Data rules:
- Phase 1 content is static + typed in `site/content/*.ts` (closings, listings, team, stats, methodology, mandates, faq) — seeded from the kwc repo (`~/Documents/Dino/dino-sites/kwc-dinomonteverde/`, read-only). Design the `Listing` type to the a100arms public-feed field allowlist so Phase 2 swaps static→live without touching components.
- Never read or expose the a100arms `a100_DealSnapshot` nested object (confidential off-market data) in any future feed work. Listing links must pass the Crexi trust check (`/^https:\/\/(www\.)?crexi\.com\//i` — keep the `i` flag; source is case-insensitive).
- FRED proxy: `site/app/api/ticker-data/route.ts`, env `FRED_API_KEY` (Vercel, server-side only), series DGS10/SOFR/DPRIME/DFEDTARU/DFEDTARL, edge cache `s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400`, always respond 200 with dash-degradable shape.
- Forms: Web3Forms with a NEW Hokuten access key (client-side key is public by design); honeypot + TCPA consent fields ported byte-exact.

Porting rules: calculator `CONFIG`/`TYPICAL`/`OCC_BAND`/`ADR_BAND`/`REVPAR_BAND`/`ADVICE` port as frozen typed config in `site/lib/valuation.ts` with unit tests locking outputs to the kwc implementation before any restyle.

Git/deploy: repo root = workspace root; `chat-context.md`, `.env*`, `.vercel` gitignored; commits authored as rawzm with no Co-Authored-By/AI-attribution trailers; deploy only via GitHub → Vercel integration (auto-deploy; never CLI-deploy). Vercel CLI (authed `razim-kw`) only for link/env/branch config with `--scope hokuten1` on project `hokuten` after a `vercel whoami` check — other teams (Dino's dino-kwc, a100arms) are off-limits. Dual theme: semantic tokens + `NEXT_PUBLIC_HOKUTEN_THEME`; `main` = gold, `theme-blue` branch (zero code diff, branch-scoped env) = blue preview URL; merge main→theme-blue after each milestone. Site is internal-only until the KW/Forward Wilshire + DRE paperwork gate clears public marketing.

Before every push: dated PROJECT-MEMORY.md entry + QA greps from design-skill reference 07 + `next build` clean.
